*~

# --- Reference-only local data (never commit) ---
/Real WhatsApp Data/

# --- Command Code ---
.commandcode/

# --- Claude Code local session config/tools (personal, not project content) ---
.claude/

# --- LaTeX build artefacts (paper/) ---
# Source is what gets archived and submitted; build outputs are regenerable.
paper/*.aux
paper/*.bbl
paper/*.blg
paper/*.log
paper/*.out
paper/*.toc
paper/*.lof
paper/*.lot
paper/*.fls
paper/*.fdb_latexmk
paper/*.synctex.gz
paper/main.pdf
# Regenerable arXiv upload bundle (main.tex + sections + tables + main.bbl).
# Rebuild with: pdflatex -> bibtex -> pdflatex -> pdflatex, then tar the sources + .bbl.
paper/arxiv-submission.tar.gz
# NOTE: arXiv wants main.bbl uploaded with the source (it does not reliably run
# bibtex). At submission, generate it and include it in the upload even though
# it is ignored here.

# --- Session scratch (tool output dumps, not project content) ---
grill-me-output.txt

# --- Convenience copy of the compiled paper (regenerable, see paper/) ---
/When-Chats-Split-Apart.pdf

# --- Source narrative for the motivating incident (real personal account, not chat data,
# but not for the permanently-archived public repo; keep local as evidentiary source) ---
/actual_problem.md

# --- Peer-review artefact (input to a revision pass, not project content) ---
/peer-review-report.docx

# --- IJMADA journal manuscript build (its own local git repo; not public) ---
/submission/

# --- Internal working files (local only; never published) ---
# Revision drafts, work-package reports, reviewer text and release runbooks.
# Superseded by submission/ and by the paper under paper/.
/CARTA_*_draft_*.md
/carta_manuscript_draft_*.md
/carta_cards_and_references.md
/REVIEWER_FEEDBACK.md
/REVISION_RECON.md
/RELEASE_PLAN.md
/WP*_REPORT.md
/WP*_PROMPT.md
/WP*_VERIFY*.md
/WP11_AUDIT.md
/IJMADA-presubmission-review.docx

# --- Internal documents kept locally but removed from the tracked tree ---
# History still holds them; these rules stop them being re-added by accident.
/CLAUDE.md
/STATE.md
/PROJECT_PLAN.md
/docs/DRAFT_PAPER.md
/docs/PAPER_BLUEPRINT.md
